WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.978
Start as Riley Ortiz, the receiving nurse. Fill the passcode and sign in.

2
00:00:05.018 --> 00:00:09.910
Open My inbox and select Jordan Vale. The pending image check is already assigned.

3
00:00:10.147 --> 00:00:14.315
Today's written report is here. The September X-ray pictures are missing.

4
00:00:14.355 --> 00:00:20.479
Open the imaging request. The checklist names the missing file, and the archive identifies the study.

5
00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:24.486
Imaging Records already has the request in the local demo inbox.

6
00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:29.226
Return to Jordan in Riley's inbox. Click Sign and send report to doctor.

7
00:00:29.266 --> 00:00:33.812
Riley can forward today's report to Avery while the earlier picture is pending.

8
00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:36.953
Sign in as Avery and open Jordan in My inbox.

9
00:00:36.993 --> 00:00:42.376
If a higher-priority case needs Avery, enter the reason and click Return handoff to admin.

10
00:00:42.613 --> 00:00:45.780
As Maya, open Jordan's transfer workspace.

11
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:49.788
Choose Morgan Lee as the new receiving doctor and click Sign and reassign.

12
00:00:50.013 --> 00:00:54.887
As Morgan, open Jordan in My inbox. Read the signed radiology impression.

13
00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:59.197
Close the source and click Sign report review. Morgan owns that decision.

14
00:00:59.447 --> 00:01:05.481
As Maya, open Jordan's Documents. Under Demo controls, click Simulate file arrival.

15
00:01:05.521 --> 00:01:10.670
Open the earlier X-ray. All four accounts can now see eight of eight expected files.

16
00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:16.025
Show the judges the original report, the automatic request, and the doctor's signature.
